        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T19:33:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yikes, that is quite the hack.\n\nI think the problem is this wasn\u0027t designed to work with an asymmetrical RO/RW. I don\u0027t have a solution off the top of my head besides introducing another config_* option that indicates that RO doesn\u0027t support the flag carryover.",
      "parentUuid": "e04a51fe_b77850d4",
      "revId": "510348ceb4608035dcd013000701de1787fa7613",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
