      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T21:18:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I\u0027m drawing a similar blank.  Do we know how many boards porting to TCPMv2 will have this issue?  Can/should we assume they\u0027re all non-EFS2 boards?",
      "parentUuid": "74f20df6_47eaa7a0",
      "revId": "510348ceb4608035dcd013000701de1787fa7613",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
