      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T23:12:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose that\u0027s about equivalent to what we ended up needing for pd_comm_allowed_by_policy(), though it\u0027s a slightly less obvious causation. \n\nWhat do you think, Patryk?",
      "parentUuid": "31928eb4_3a3db8d8",
